WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.740
Hey, welcome back to 40 Days of Holiness.

2
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.360
Today is day 33, and today we are talking about what

3
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:17.380
happens after the moment where Christ comes

4
00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:21.280
in and rules by the power of the Spirit, expulses from

5
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:21.840
our heart

6
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:26.480
that old self, that old nature that corrupts everything that

7
00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:30.040
we do, and replaces that heart of stone with a heart of flesh.

8
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:34.160
And so I frequently have people ask me, what happens after that?

9
00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:37.980
Does that mean that everything in my life suddenly is completely perfect?

10
00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:41.920
What if I trust God to give me freedom from sin,

11
00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:46.480
and freedom of, and I repudiate the sin nature, as we talked about

12
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.460
in Romans 6, and believe that Christ has set

13
00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:51.300
me completely free.

14
00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:54.820
When I appropriate those riches by faith,

15
00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:59.400
what happens then? Does it mean that if I find

16
00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:03.280
something in my life that's sinful or that is self-centered

17
00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:07.800
or that is wrong, that it means that it wasn't real back there, nothing ever

18
00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:08.500
